Changes dated 2026-11-25
The application, build configuration, packaging, and documentation have been
modified for Private Translate. This snapshot starts the public change history.

Third-party software
* The patched lopdf sources under patches/lopdf carry their own MIT licence.
  Local changes add a cumulative stream decoding budget across parsing,
  content processing, and font processing.
* llama.cpp is MIT-licensed. The macOS package patch loads bundled precompiled Metal shaders, with embedded shaders as a fallback.
* The llama.cpp and Lucide licence texts are under licenses/.
* The macOS package includes PDFium, IPA fonts, Noto fonts, and their licences.
  scripts/notices.sh generates the complete package notices, including the
  Rust dependencies. Models and the optional BabelDOC engine are separate.
